      "description": "Create AI Videos and Images for Marketing, Stories & Design\n\nPollo AI is an all-in-one creative app for marketers, online sellers, small businesses, and creators. It brings an AI video generator, AI image generator, AI ad maker, and built-in design tools together in one place.\n\nTurn ideas, scripts, photos, product images, URLs, or reference videos into polished, publish-ready content for ads, social media, online stores, and creative projects.\n\nAI MARKETING & E-COMMERCE\n\nCreate professional marketing content without filming, complex editing, or a full production team.\n\n• AI video ads for social media and paid campaigns\n• UGC ads, testimonial videos, and product reviews\n• Product demos, product showcases, and unboxing videos\n• Virtual try-on and product-in-use videos\n• Brand stories, promotional videos, and campaign creatives\n• Multiple hooks, angles, and ad variations for testing\n• Product photos, posters, banners, and store visuals\n• Background removal for clean product images\n\nSTORY VIDEOS & CREATIVE CONTENT\n\nBring characters, stories, and original ideas to life with AI.\n\n• AI story videos and cinematic short films\n• AI music videos, anime videos, and stylized content\n• TikTok videos, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts\n• Character-driven scenes and visually consistent stories\n• Multi-scene videos with cinematic motion and audio\n• Reference-based videos and creative remixes\n• Video effects, transformations, and viral templates\n\nFROM IDEA TO PUBLISH-READY CONTENT\n\nPollo AI goes beyond generating individual AI clips.\n\n• AI Agent: Turn a simple brief into a complete video with a compelling hook, clear script, and cohesive scenes\n• 200+ AI Apps: Explore guided workflows for ads, product contents, stories, images, and videos\n• Clone & Remix: Recreate a reference video’s structure and style with your own content\n• Create for Every Format: Make vertical, square, or landscape content for social media, ads, and online stores\n\nAI VIDEO GENERATOR\n\nCreate videos using:\n\n• Text to video \n• Image to video \n• Reference to video \n• Video to video \n• Frames to video \n• AI avatars and voices \n• Video effects and motion tools\n\nAI IMAGE GENERATOR & DESIGN TOOLS\n\nCreate and refine visuals using:\n\n• Text to image \n• Image to image \n• AI posters and promotional graphics \n• Product photography and marketing images \n• AI photo editor and image enhancer \n• Image upscaler \n• Background remover\n\nLEADING AI MODELS IN ONE APP\n\nAccess a growing collection of AI video and image models, including Pollo, Seedance 2.5, Veo 3.1, Sora 2, Kling, Wan, Hailuo, Vidu, PixVerse, Luma, Pika, GPT Image 2, Nano Banana, Seedream, Flux, Midjourney, Ideogram, Recraft, and more.\n\nChoose the right model for cinematic storytelling, realistic motion, native audio, consistent characters, accurate text, product photography, posters, and professional design.\n\nBUILT FOR\n\n• Small business owners and online sellers\n• Performance marketers and social media managers\n• E-commerce brands and agencies\n• Filmmakers, designers, and storytellers\n• Influencers, freelancers, and content teams\n\nLaunch products, promote services, produce paid ads, create organic social content, bring original stories to life, and explore new creative possibilities with Pollo AI.\n\nCreate your next ad, product video, story, poster, or social post with Pollo AI.\n\nWebsite: https://pollo.ai\nPrivacy Policy: https://pollo.ai/privacy-policy\nTerms: https://pollo.ai/terms-and-conditions\nRefund Policy: https://pollo.ai/refund-policy",
